{"id": "385720", "name": "נגזרת של פונקציה הפוכה – e^(a/xⁿ+b/xᵐ)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "f", "params": ["x"], "body": "exp(a/(x^n)+b/(x^m))"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונה הפונקציה הבאה:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f:(0,\\infty) \\rightarrow (1,\\infty), \\qquad f(x)={{CT:0}} \\]</p><p>ידוע שהפונקציה הזו היא הפיכה. נסמן את הפונקציה ההפוכה לה כך</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ g(x)=f^{-1}(x) : (1,\\infty) \\rightarrow (0,\\infty) \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>מצאו את הנגזרת של הפונקציה ההפוכה בנקודה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(p=f(1)={{CT:1}}\\)</span> (רשמו את הערך המדויק).</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( g' ({{CT:1}}) = \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> לא צריך למצוא את הפונקציה ההפוכה: הנגזרת שלה בנקודה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(p=f(1)\\)</span> היא ההופכי של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f'(1)\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — הנגזרת של הפונקציה ההפוכה</b><br>כיוון ש-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g(f(x))=x\\)</span>, גזירה לפי כלל השרשרת נותנת <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g'(f(x))\\cdot f'(x)=1\\)</span>. הנקודה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(p={{CT:1}}\\)</span> היא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f(1)\\)</span>, ולכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ g'({{CT:1}})=\\frac{1}{f'(1)} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — הנגזרת של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f\\)</span></b><br>לפי כלל השרשרת, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f(x)=e^{u(x)}\\)</span> עם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u(x)={{CT:2}}\\)</span>, ולכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f'(x)=e^{u(x)}\\,u'(x)={{CT:3}} \\]</p>בנקודה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x=1\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f'(1)={{CT:4}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — התשובה</b><br>לכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ g'({{CT:1}})=\\frac{1}{{{CT:4}}}={{CT:5}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "<p>Correct answer, well done.</p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p>Your answer is partially correct.</p>", "prtincorrect": "<p>Incorrect answer.</p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "tans1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "df1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<p>זו הנגזרת <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f'(1)\\)</span>. הנגזרת של הפונקציה ההפוכה היא ההופכי שלה: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g'(f(1))=\\frac{1}{f'(1)}\\)</span>.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "-1/(n*a+m*b)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-T", "feedback": "<p>לפי כלל השרשרת <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\left(e^{u}\\right)'=e^{u}u'\\)</span>: אל תשכחו את הגורם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(e^{u(1)}\\)</span>.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "-tans1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-4-T", "feedback": "<p>בדקו את הסימן: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\left(x^{-n}\\right)'=-nx^{-n-1}\\)</span>.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-4-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["a", "b", "df1", "m", "n", "p", "tans1"], "nvariants": 50}